#: plugins/pantoken/custom-icons/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-custom-icons` — vendored custom icon glyphs for downstream consumers."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-custom-icons` — продистрибуовані власні гліфи іконок для кінцевих споживачів."

#: plugins/pantoken/custom-icons/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Brings in icons that aren't part of the InstUI set (product/brand marks, etc.) as\n`--instui-icon-<name>` image tokens — the same namespace and `.-icon-<name>` painter class the\nbuilt-in InstUI icons use, so a custom icon drops into `.instui-icon -icon-<name>` exactly like a\nbuilt-in one. No `custom-` prefix: on a name collision, the built-in InstUI icon should win (load\nit after this plugin's CSS in any combine URL)."
msgstr "Brings in icons that aren't part of the InstUI set (product/brand marks, etc.) as\n`--instui-icon-&lt;name&gt;` image tokens — the same namespace and `.-icon-&lt;name&gt;` painter class the\nbuilt-in InstUI icons use, so a custom icon drops into `.instui-icon -icon-&lt;name&gt;` exactly like a\nbuilt-in one. No `custom-` prefix: on a name collision, the built-in InstUI icon should win (load\nit after this plugin's CSS in any combine URL)."

